{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14222260","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14222260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1422226001:1":{"text":"물론 여긴 덥지. 하지만 드워프가 없으면 스틸헤드들의 마음은 추울 거야.","source_cn":"虽然这里很炎热，但没有矮人的陪伴，铁脑袋们的心是寒冷的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928D8025F7930988","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422226002:1":{"text":"시간이 지나면 스틸헤드들은 아무도 신경쓰지 않는 고철 더미가 될 거고...","source_cn":"很多年过去后，铁脑袋们会变成一堆不被人在意的废铁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB2565D3DF2AD4E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422226003:1":{"text":"그 누구도 스틸헤드가 움직이고, 공격할 수 있었고, 경계하면서 말할 수 있었다는 걸 기억하지 못하겠지...","source_cn":"不会有人知道它们曾经能动，能攻击，能警戒，能说话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6AABB56166C8F35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422226004:1":{"text":"내가 직접 짊어지고라도 지상으로 데려가겠어!","source_cn":"哪怕亲自背，我也要把它们背上地面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x297E7077FEA92AEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:胆大的矮人机械师":{"text":"대담한 드워프 기계공학가","source":"胆大的矮人机械师","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:谨慎的矮人机械师":{"text":"신중한 드워프 기계공학가","source":"谨慎的矮人机械师","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}